@MrImranPk Over the last couple of days we have seen escalated conflict in Iran, Poland, Ukraine, Russia, France, Yemen and Sudan. 

Governments are telling you to buy food and water. 

Precious metals, crypto and markets are red. What will next week look like?

@KobeissiLetter If confirmed by the FBI, this goes far beyond a crypto exchange hack.

The deeper issue is whether increasingly institutionalized crypto markets have built security and custody infrastructure capable of handling state-level threats.

Recovering funds matters. Restoring trust
